# Copy to `.env`. Never commit real keys — `.env` is gitignored and a
# pre-commit hook blocks it.

# Google Places — the only source that reliably returns a business's own
# website, which is what answers "do they even have one?".
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# Yelp Fusion (free key) — covers the local service businesses that
# OpenStreetMap does not list. https://www.yelp.com/developers/v3/manage_app
YELP_API_KEY=

# OpenStreetMap needs no key and is always used.

# Where generated site previews are served from. Defaults to the port the
# server actually listens on (app.core.config.DEFAULT_PORT); set this only
# when serving from somewhere else. Two definitions drifted once already.
# PREVIEW_BASE_URL=

# The language model's key — design runs (make design), chat edits in the
# workbench, and reading menus published as images. Design runs and edits spend
# real money: up to $5 a design, $1 an edit.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Which models to use, by the identifier the provider publishes. The code names
# none. DESIGN_MODEL is for design runs and chat edits; ANTHROPIC_MODEL is for
# menu images and the older generator's instruction reader.
DESIGN_MODEL=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=
